{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2025-05/1061325/block/singleImage/3254201/df/an_0.jpeg?updatedAt=1793432689\"/><figcaption>牛頭角六旬婦被指買保險涉洗黑錢，為「調查」痛失270萬元。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (31 日 ) 凌晨近 5 時，警方接獲牛頭角安基苑一名 66 歲姓鍾婦人報案，指自己於本周三 (28 日 ) 接獲一名男子來電，對方聲稱她曾在網上購買保險，指其戶口涉及洗黑錢活動，要求她轉帳作調查。 鍾婦不虞有詐，分別將 200 萬元及 70 萬元轉到指定的兩個銀行戶口。及後她感到擔心，懷疑遭遇電話騙案於是報案。案件列「詐騙」跟進，暫未有人被捕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:38.450800+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T07:44:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.791670+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:28.813459+00:00","content_hash":"13a05f9a06be23e40e9809501b692a0c307537beb074bf9a75c8f0ba1c38056d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:38.450800+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}